</tbody>
</table>
</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Top 5 misclassifications for MathDial and AlgebraNation with GPT-4o, comparing inputs with vs. without previous tutor moves. The most common confusion in MathDial is between <span id="A2.T7.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">focus</span> and <span id="A2.T7.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">probing</span>. The most common confusion in AlgebraNation is between <span id="A2.T7.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">giving instruction</span> and <span id="A2.T7.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">giving explanation</span>. Overall, including previous tutor moves decreases the top 4 misclassifications rates.</figcaption>
</figure>
